<!--
  MLIE_FAUNA_ABSORPTION_1 Wave C — Dactillion creature port.
  Ported from mlie.starwarsanimalcollection's `Dactillion` ThingDef/PawnKindDef
  pair (Races_Animal_SW.xml, workshop folder 3497316713), renamed under the
  RSW_ tier prefix. Geometry/stats/comps copied verbatim. Custom body: the
  donor's `Bogwing` BodyDef (Bodies_Animal_StarWars.xml) is NOT vanilla Core
  (confirmed absent from Core's Bodies_Animal_Quadruped.xml/Bodies_Animal_Bird.xml
  — checked directly, RimSage is blind to this donor per the 2026-09-12
  sweep note) — ported here as RSW_Bogwing, defName rename plus repointing
  its 2 wing parts to the ALREADY-PORTED Wave B RSW_SW_LeftWing/
  RSW_SW_RightWing (same repoint the CanCell port already made) — no new
  body part needed. Every other part (Tail, Spine, Stomach, Heart, Lung x2,
  Kidney x2, Liver, Neck/Head/Skull/Brain/Eye x2/Ear x2/Nose/Beak, 4x
  Leg/Paw) is vanilla Core, confirmed against the same donor file read
  directly. NOTE: the donor's `Bogwing` BodyDef is unrelated to the
  still-unported `Bogwing` species (own bare defName, out of this item's
  current worklist) — they merely share a name; only the BODY is ported
  this pass.

  `leatherDef`/`specificMeatDef` repoint to the already-ported
  RSW_Leather_Reptavian/RSW_Reptavian_Meat (Wave B). Its
  `CompProperties_EggLayer` needed 2 new eggs, RSW_EggDactillionFertilized/
  UnFertilized (RSW_MlieWaveC_Resources.xml, texPath swresource/EggWiggly,
  newly extracted this pass). Its Odyssey specialTrainable (AttackTarget)
  is vanilla content, left unprefixed. Sounds repoint to the
  already-absorbed sound wave (RSW_Pawn_Dactillion_*, 2026-09-02). texPaths
  are unchanged text — extracted art (16 PNGs: base body/dessicated for 3
  directions plus the full 4-frame flying animation set for 3 directions)
  sits at Textures/swanimals/Dactillion/ (extract_bundle.py against the
  same AssetBundle every prior wave used; 3 extra "DactillionPack" textures
  in the bundle are unreferenced by any donor def, left unextracted).

  Wired into the live cast this same pass: ZBiome_DesertOasis (per
  cast_assignment.csv's current row for this species), repointed from the
  bare "Dactillion" entry in cast_assignment.csv / BiomeCast_Ashkarr.xml.
-->
<Defs>
<ThingDef ParentName="AnimalThingBase" ADogSaidBody="LegsTail">
    <defName>RSW_Dactillion</defName>
    <label>dactillion</label>
    <description>The dactillions were a reptavian native to the sinkhole world of Utapau. Dactillions shared both avian and lizard traits, with long, thin wings and thick, scaled hides. A dactillion's pair of wings allowed it to ride the thermal updrafts in a Utapau sinkhole, and its prominent limbs allowed it to scale the rocky side. An avian cousin of the speedy varactyl, the dactillion served as a mounts.</description>
